      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-09T19:18:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "yeah, I like board_user_is_present() or board_user_has_ownership() or something like that. I think that would help.",
      "parentUuid": "3ee28b21_6a8c7b10",
      "range": {
