        "id": 1136059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-12T22:27:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general I think the naming in this patch is weird. In terms of cr50 naming schemes physical presence refers specifically to power button pressing and battery presence refers specifically to BATT_PRES_L(DIOM2). \nMaybe these names will make more sense when physical presence stuff is incorporated, but right now I find the names really confusing, because this patch only really covers battery presence, but all of the names seem to emphasize physical presence.\n\nI think jett is right maybe a board_user_has_ownership or something would be good, because we could determine what \"owned\" means based on the board properties, but I think maybe that renaming should be done in the physical presence patch??????",
      "parentUuid": "366ce188_3ac0fe9e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 224,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 224,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "074d7eb916295003189b78c58027b84e8eb2e579",
